    "description": "For most musicians, opportunities like this mean getting on a flight.\n\nThis time, the opportunity is flying to Ranchi.\n\nAman Moroney (@aman_moroney), producer of We Dance by Coldplay, performed at the FIFA World Cup, is joining us for an intimate gathering at Shoonya World all the way from Los Angeles.\n\nBeyond his work with international artists and projects, Aman is an A&R and has spent years mentoring emerging musicians and helping them navigate the realities of the music industry.\n\nIf you're a singer, songwriter, producer, or audio engineer, this is your chance to ask questions, gain real industry insights, and learn in a small, interactive setting where conversations matter.\n\nWe've intentionally kept the gathering intimate, so seats are limited.\n\nFill in the application form today. :)\n\n📍 Shoonya World, Ranchi\n📅 2nd August\n\nReserve your spot before registrations close.",
